sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as Khách hàng
    actor Guest as Khách vãng lai
    actor Admin as Admin/Staff
    participant FE as Frontend Webapp
    participant API as Backend API
    participant ReviewSvc as Review Service
    participant SupportSvc as Support Service
    participant AuditSvc as Audit Log Service
    participant OrderSvc as Order Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant FS as File Storage

    Note over Customer,FS: 14-16. Luồng review, support, audit/log

    opt Khách xem review theo sản phẩm
        Guest->>FE: Mở chi tiết sản phẩm
        FE->>API: GET /reviews/product/{productId}
        API->>ReviewSvc: Lấy review public
        ReviewSvc->>DB: Query reviews by product
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(reviews, meta)
        FE-->>Guest: Hiển thị review + rating
    end

    opt Khách tạo review sau khi mua/thuê
        Customer->>FE: Viết review sản phẩm
        FE->>API: POST /reviews multipart/json
        API->>ReviewSvc: @PreAuthorize ORDER_WRITE
        ReviewSvc->>OrderSvc: Kiểm tra user đã mua/thuê sản phẩm
        OrderSvc->>DB: Query completed orders
        ReviewSvc->>FS: Lưu ảnh review nếu có
        ReviewSvc->>DB: Insert review + images
        ReviewSvc->>AuditSvc: Ghi log review
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(review)
        FE-->>Customer: Hiển thị review mới
    end

    opt Khách sửa/xóa review của mình
        Customer->>FE: Sửa hoặc xóa review
        alt Sửa review
            FE->>API: PUT /reviews/{id}
            API->>ReviewSvc: Kiểm tra chủ sở hữu review
            ReviewSvc->>DB: Update review
        else Xóa review
            FE->>API: DELETE /reviews/{id}
            API->>ReviewSvc: Kiểm tra chủ sở hữu review
            ReviewSvc->>DB: Delete/soft delete review
        end
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(result)
        FE-->>Customer: Cập nhật danh sách review
    end

    opt Khách report review xấu/sai
        Customer->>FE: Báo cáo review
        FE->>API: POST /reviews/{id}/report
        API->>ReviewSvc: @PreAuthorize ORDER_READ
        ReviewSvc->>DB: Mark review reported
        ReviewSvc->>AuditSvc: Ghi log report
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(success)
    end

    opt Admin xem review bị report/hidden và xử lý
        Admin->>FE: Mở moderation reviews
        FE->>API: GET /reviews/reported hoặc /reviews/hidden
        API->>ReviewSvc: @PreAuthorize REVIEW_MANAGE
        ReviewSvc->>DB: Query reported/hidden reviews
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(reviews)

        Admin->>FE: Ẩn/hiện/xử lý review
        FE->>API: Admin review action endpoint
        API->>ReviewSvc: Validate action
        ReviewSvc->>DB: Update review moderation status
        ReviewSvc->>AuditSvc: Ghi log moderation
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(result)
    end

    opt Support ticket
        Guest->>FE: Gửi ticket hỗ trợ public
        FE->>API: POST /support/tickets
        API->>SupportSvc: Tạo ticket
        SupportSvc->>DB: Insert support ticket
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(ticket)

        Admin->>FE: Xem danh sách/chi tiết ticket
        FE->>API: GET /admin/support/tickets
        API->>SupportSvc: @PreAuthorize SUPPORT_READ
        SupportSvc->>DB: Query tickets
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(tickets)

        Admin->>FE: Cập nhật trạng thái/phản hồi ticket
        FE->>API: PUT /admin/support/tickets/{id}/status hoặc /reply
        API->>SupportSvc: @PreAuthorize SUPPORT_WRITE
        SupportSvc->>DB: Update status/reply
        SupportSvc->>AuditSvc: Ghi log support action
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(ticket)
    end

    opt Audit/log
        API->>AuditSvc: Backend ghi log hoạt động quan trọng
        AuditSvc->>DB: Insert audit log
        Admin->>FE: Mở audit logs
        FE->>API: GET /audit-logs
        API->>AuditSvc: @PreAuthorize USER_READ
        AuditSvc->>DB: Query audit logs
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(audit logs)
        FE-->>Admin: Dashboard hiển thị recent activities/audit logs
    end
